      "handle": "kii-aa-washed-sl28",
      "body_html": "<h3 class=\"p1\">Double Washed SL28</h3>\n<h4 class=\"p1\">Rung\u2019eto Cooperative, Kenya</h4>\n<p class=\"p3\">Under the steady leadership of Samuel Karanja, the farmers of Kii work as one body, united by shared values and a common goal. Visiting their cooperative each year, I\u2019ve seen how their initiatives\u2014like a member bank and dairy project\u2014create cycles of growth and reinvestment, directly improving lives.</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">This is Kenyan coffee at its finest: a product of community-driven excellence, where the collective pursuit of quality transforms every cup into a story of resilience and unity.</p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">Flavor Notes:</span></strong><span class=\"s2\"> </span><em>Pineapple, Bruleed Grapefruit, Papaya, and Florals\u00a0</em></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><strong>Brewing Tips:</st",
