      "body_html": "<h3>Cascara Infused Carbonic Maceration</h3>\n<h4>Finca Deborah, Panama</h4>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 128, 0);\">*Reserve coffees are on a limited roasting schedule. Anything ordered with it will be delayed and shipped alongside it.</span></p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" dir=\"ltr\">Jamison Savage has taken the queen of varieties and married her to wine processing, producing some of the most wildly beautiful coffees we've ever discovered. He's become one of, if not the, foremost producer of Carbonic Maceration experimental Geishas in the world, dialing in unique processes that combine different gases, pressures, extended times, and pH levels to create flavor profiles uniquely his own.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body br",
